<title>RUSSIA: Lukoil 1st half net profit sharply up.</title>
<headline>Lukoil 1st half net profit sharply up.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>		    (in billions of roubles)</p>
<p>					 1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Sales			   23,641	    6,769</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     2,513		923</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 2,108		828</p>
<p>    Net profit		     1,774		649</p>
<p>    Receivables		   13,783	    4,713</p>
<p>    Accounts payable	    13,373	    5,688</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name OAO NK LUKoil. Receivables and accounts payable at end of period. Figures are preliminary. Final figures to be released next week. Figures are not audited, are stated to Russian accounting standards, and are not fully consolidated.</p>
<p>On Thursday, LUKoil vice-president Leonid Fedun said pre-tax profit in the first half of this year was around 1.4 trillion roubles. But LUKoil said on Friday in a statement that this figure referred solely to pre-tax profit in oil production.</p>
<p>--Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
